# Weather architecture note

When you change the weather app under `weather/`, update `weather/ARCHITECTURE.md` in the same change.

Cover anything a reader would get wrong if the note stayed stale: folders, ports, how to start and stop, the frontend request, the backend response, and the Open-Meteo calls. Keep the note in plain language and match the code that is actually running.
